  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSALeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: ምናልባት የይለፍ ቃልዎን ቢረሱ 3 የደህንነት ጥያቄዎችን ይምረጡ።ምላሾችዎ የማይረሳ መሆኑን ያረጋግጡ ።
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSAErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: You’ll need to finish entering your security questions before you can continue.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Third one's a charm. Choose your last question, type the answer, and you're good to go.
