    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Now for the second one. Same drill.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Now you can set up 3 security questions to help you reset your password if you forget it. Choose the first question and type your answer.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder3:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: የመድህን ጥያቄ (3 ከ 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder2:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: የመድህን ጥያቄ (2 ከ 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder1:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: የመድህን ጥያቄ (1 ከ 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion6:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: ትምህርት የጀመሩበት ትምህርት ቤት ስም ማን ይባላል?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion5:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: በድሜ ትልቋ አክስትዎ ስም ማን ይባላል?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion4:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: ወላጆችዎ የተገናኙበት ከተማ ማን ይባላል?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion3:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: በልጅነትዎ የነበረዎት ቅጥያ ስም ምን ነበር?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion2:
