  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: መሳሪያዎ ከWindows Hello ጋር የሚሰራ የጣት አሻራ ፈታሽ አለው፣ ይህም ማንነትዎን ለማረጋገጥ ቀላልና ከይለፍ ቃል ነጻ የሆነ መንገድ ይሰጥዎታል።
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: ካሜራዎ እርስዎን ለመለየት ከWindows Hello ጋር ይሰራል፣ ይህም የእርስዎን ማንነት ለማረጋገጥ ቀላልና ከይለፍ ቃል ነጻ የሆነ መንገድ ይሰጥዎታል።
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Windows Hello የጣት አሻራ አዶ
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Windows Hello ፊት አዶ
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceAnimationAltText:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: Windows Hello ፊት ተልወስዋሽ
  \oobeHello\HelloContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: ይቀጥሉ
  \oobeHello\HelloButtonText:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: አዎ፣ አሁን ያቀናብሩት
  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataTitle:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: አይ፣ በመለያ እንዴት እንደምገባ ቀይር
  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: በመለያ መግቢያ አማራጮችን ወደማስወግድበት እና ውሂቤን ወደምሰርዝበት ቅንብሮች ውሰደኝ።
  \oobeHello\BioConsentTitle:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: በፊትዎ ወይም በጣት አሻራዎ መግባት መቀጠል ከፈለጉ ይምረጡ
  \oobeHello\BioConsentSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=AM-ET: በዚህ የግል ኮምፒዩተር ላይ የፊት ወይም የጣት አሻራ ውሂብን ማከማቸት መቀጠል ይፈልጋሉ?
